      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Further description from @{5961d55a0eff1e3f71eaf747|full_name}\n\n\"\nIf station forward direction not aligned with world +Z coordinate when someone sitting on station, avatar breaking after station starts rotating. At screenshot only central station not breaking avatars when someone picking up this station and rotating it. This bug always existed in VRChat, it not related to current beta or 2017 update, it only affects VR users.\n\n Test world id: wrld_6254fd32-988b-4c2d-9f1a-164d4368af22\n\"",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
