      "mergeID": "5c3ce5d5238f1440ddd18f5e",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I make theme parks.. and funland is not the only map im building, thus i need a working state of the vrc_station so that when positions or rotations happen the avatar follows along for the ride and doesn't sink into the abyss of the chair.\n\nIn most cases the head's camera actually detaches from the body and appears to be underneath the avatar, or as for roller-coasters as a camera tilts back at 90 degrees and thus the camera remains at the back of the ride looking at the avatar in the seat tilted back like something out of the exorcist.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Chairs station \"Pos/Rot\" avatar fix.",
